*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0019
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 236
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0019.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    05 EY-YY              PIC 9(2).
    *> GROSS ANNUAL INCOME
    05 AI-AMT             PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> MAXIMUM LOAN AMOUNT
    05 M-PR               PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM MAX-LOAN-CALC
    DISPLAY "M-PR=" M-PR
    STOP RUN.
MAX-LOAN-CALC.
    IF EY-YY >= 7
        COMPUTE M-PR = AI-AMT * 5
    ELSE
        *> STANDARD EMPLOYMENT MULTIPLE
        IF EY-YY >= 2
            COMPUTE M-PR ROUNDED = AI-AMT * 3
        ELSE
            COMPUTE M-PR = AI-AMT * 1.5
        END-IF
    END-IF.
